Global Security Intelligence Hub
Unified Investigations Dashboard with Predictive Analytics

This codebase implements the Global Security Intelligence Hub proposal: the canonical
investigations data model, the streaming and batch ingestion paths, the serving API, the
predictive analytics layer, the three role-based dashboards, and the infrastructure
definitions.

